{"id": "EUVD-2026-103077", "enisaUuid": "85d0b453-43aa-36dc-97a3-2bf794b7a5ee", "description": "ThinkAdmin think-plugs-admin through 1.0.81 contains an insecure direct object reference vulnerability that allows non-super administrators to read and overwrite other administrators' file records via admin/file.edit. Attackers holding the admin/file.edit node can request or POST a target id with columns like xurl, hash, or uuid to view download URLs, tamper records, or reassign ownership.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:39:21", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T13:20:25", "baseScore": 5.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:H/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/thinkadmin-file-edit-missing-owner-scope-idor", "https://github.com/zoujingli/think-plugs-admin/blob/v1.0.81/src/controller/File.php#L52-L82", "https://github.com/zoujingli/ThinkLibrary/blob/v6.1.101/src/helper/FormHelper.php#L51-L86", "https://github.com/zoujingli/ThinkLibrary/blob/v6.1.101/src/service/SystemService.php#L206-L222", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/thinkadmin-think-plugs-admin-through-1.0.81-idor-via-admin-file-edit"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111655", "GHSA-wcpc-prgf-22hq"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.25, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "6bd73521-aed6-3fb5-87b4-9526d7eab109", "product": {"name": "think-plugs-admin", "vendor": {"name": "zoujingli"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.0.81"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "aaadecdc-f1cb-36d0-9a5e-bf5658625365", "vendor": {"name": "zoujingli"}}], "isExploited": false}